  {
   "id": "el38_800675",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1756,
   "y": 736.5,
   "width": 599.04,
   "height": 652.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 166688708,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1641903440,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1795464137622,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "«model»\n   Plain data entity, a noun from the requirements.\n   Holds state + getters, very little logic.\n   Book, Item, Seat, Vehicle, User\n\n«abstract»\n   Cannot be instantiated. Has at least one pure virtual method,\n   but may also hold fields and shared code.\n   virtual double area() const = 0;\n   Always give it a virtual destructor.\n\n«interface»\n   Pure contract: only pure virtual methods, no data.\n   PaymentStrategy, Shape, Notifier\n   Implemented with a dashed line + hollow triangle.\n\n«singleton»\n   Exactly one instance. Private constructor, deleted copy,\n   static getInstance().   Inventory, OrderManager, Logger\n\nOthers you will see:\n   «enum»  Status, Type, Mode\n   «service»  stateless behaviour (NotificationService)\n   «facade» / orchestrator  the App / Controller class\n   «utility»  static helpers (TimeUtils, IdGenerator)\n\nAbstract vs interface:  abstract = \"is a kind of, shares code\"\n                                   interface = \"can do this\"\n",
   "originalText": "«model»\n   Plain data entity, a noun from the requirements.\n   Holds state + getters, very little logic.\n   Book, Item, Seat, Vehicle, User\n\n«abstract»\n   Cannot be instantiated. Has at least one pure virtual method,\n   but may also hold fields and shared code.\n   virtual double area() const = 0;\n   Always give it a virtual destructor.\n\n«interface»\n   Pure contract: only pure virtual methods, no data.\n   PaymentStrategy, Shape, Notifier\n   Implemented with a dashed line + hollow triangle.\n\n«singleton»\n   Exactly one instance. Private constructor, deleted copy,\n   static getInstance().   Inventory, OrderManager, Logger\n\nOthers you will see:\n   «enum»  Status, Type, Mode\n   «service»  stateless behaviour (NotificationService)\n   «facade» / orchestrator  the App / Controller class\n   «utility»  static helpers (TimeUtils, IdGenerator)\n\nAbstract vs interface:  abstract = \"is a kind of, shares code\"\n                                   interface = \"can do this\"\n",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
