   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1795464137622,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Picking the right arrow",
   "originalText": "Picking the right arrow",
   "fontSize": 30,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "el127_460717",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 936.0,
   "y": 2493.0,
   "width": 604.8,
   "height": 300.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1717221869,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1381117824,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1795464137622,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Ask these in order, stop at the first YES:\n\nQ1  Is A a kind of B?\n      → Inheritance  (dashed = Realization if B is «interface»)\nQ2  Does A NOT store B as a member?\n      (only a param / local / return / creates it)\n      → Dependency\nQ3  Does A own B's lifetime?\n      (B is created with A, dies with A, never shared)\n      → Composition  ◆\nQ4  Is A a container of Bs that live elsewhere?\n      (B survives without A, can be shared)\n      → Aggregation  ◇\nQ5  Otherwise A just keeps a pointer to B\n      → Association  ──>",
   "originalText": "Ask these in order, stop at the first YES:\n\nQ1  Is A a kind of B?\n      → Inheritance  (dashed = Realization if B is «interface»)\nQ2  Does A NOT store B as a member?\n      (only a param / local / return / creates it)\n      → Dependency\nQ3  Does A own B's lifetime?\n      (B is created with A, dies with A, never shared)\n      → Composition  ◆\nQ4  Is A a container of Bs that live elsewhere?\n      (B survives without A, can be shared)\n      → Aggregation  ◇\nQ5  Otherwise A just keeps a pointer to B\n      → Association  ──>",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
