   "updated": 1795464137622,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Common UML mistakes",
   "originalText": "Common UML mistakes",
   "fontSize": 30,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "el130_920304",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1846.0,
   "y": 2493.0,
   "width": 533.52,
   "height": 562.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1527919545,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1610914378,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1795464137622,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "• Multiplicity 1...* (three dots) → write 1..*\n\n• Solid triangle line to an «interface»\n  → dashed line (realization)\n\n• Diamond on the wrong end\n  → it always sits on the WHOLE\n\n• Storing something you don't own by value\n  → use a pointer (association)\n\n• Abstract type stored by value (Strategy s)\n  → pointer or reference (else it can't compile / slices)\n\n• \"Creates\" drawn as association → it's a dependency\n\n• Members without + / -, arrows without labels\n  or multiplicity\n\n• Type mismatches (int total, double price)\n\n• Inheritance used only to reuse code\n  → prefer composition\n\n• One god class that does everything",
   "originalText": "• Multiplicity 1...* (three dots) → write 1..*\n\n• Solid triangle line to an «interface»\n  → dashed line (realization)\n\n• Diamond on the wrong end\n  → it always sits on the WHOLE\n\n• Storing something you don't own by value\n  → use a pointer (association)\n\n• Abstract type stored by value (Strategy s)\n  → pointer or reference (else it can't compile / slices)\n\n• \"Creates\" drawn as association → it's a dependency\n\n• Members without + / -, arrows without labels\n  or multiplicity\n\n• Type mismatches (int total, double price)\n\n• Inheritance used only to reuse code\n  → prefer composition\n\n• One god class that does everything",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "el131_309001",
