   "updated": 1795464137622,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "UML + LLD tips",
   "originalText": "UML + LLD tips",
   "fontSize": 30,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "el136_520884",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 936.0,
   "y": 3195.5,
   "width": 477.36,
   "height": 337.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1596337780,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 2033231095,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1795464137622,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "• Every box has 3 parts: «stereotype» + name,\n   attributes, methods\n• Label every arrow: has-a / is-a + multiplicity\n• Arrow direction = who knows whom (navigability)\n• Prefer composition over inheritance\n• Program to interfaces (Strategy*, Factory*)\n• Keep models dumb (data + getters); logic lives in\n   managers and services\n• One class, one reason to change (SRP)\n• No god class: the facade delegates, it doesn't do\n   the work itself\n• No include cycles: forward-declare when you only\n   hold a pointer\n• Abstract base classes need a virtual destructor\n• Finish by naming extensions you'd add next",
   "originalText": "• Every box has 3 parts: «stereotype» + name,\n   attributes, methods\n• Label every arrow: has-a / is-a + multiplicity\n• Arrow direction = who knows whom (navigability)\n• Prefer composition over inheritance\n• Program to interfaces (Strategy*, Factory*)\n• Keep models dumb (data + getters); logic lives in\n   managers and services\n• One class, one reason to change (SRP)\n• No god class: the facade delegates, it doesn't do\n   the work itself\n• No include cycles: forward-declare when you only\n   hold a pointer\n• Abstract base classes need a virtual destructor\n• Finish by naming extensions you'd add next",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
